---
const problems = [
  { icon: "🤷", text: "Message flou — personne ne comprend ce que tu fais" },
  { icon: "🚫", text: "Mauvais clients — ou pas de clients du tout" },
  { icon: "⏳", text: "Tu perds du temps à expliquer ton offre" },
  { icon: "📉", text: "On te compare aux moins chers" },
];
---

<section class="problem section-pad" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-layout">
      <div class="problem-text">
        <div class="section-tag">Le vrai problème</div>
        <h2 class="section-h2">Tu as un site.<br/><em>Il ne travaille pas pour toi.</em></h2>
        <p class="problem-body">
          Le problème, c'est pas ton offre. C'est pas ton prix.<br/>
          C'est que ton site ne dit pas clairement pourquoi on devrait te choisir.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        {problems.map(p => (
          <div class="problem-card">
            <span class="problem-icon">{p.icon}</span>
            <span class="problem-label">{p.text}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-result">
      <p>Résultat : <strong>les bons clients partent chez quelqu'un qui a un message plus clair.</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-cta-wrap">
      <a href="#commander" class="problem-cta">Je veux corriger ça</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.section-tag {
  display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--accent);
  background: var(--accent-pale); padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.section-h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.1; }
.section-h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }

.problem-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

.problem-body {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.problem-cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
}

.problem-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.problem-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(232,98,44,0.08);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.problem-icon {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--cream);
  border-radius: 10px;
}

.problem-label {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.problem-result {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.problem-result p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.problem-result strong {
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.problem-cta-wrap { text-align: center; }
.problem-cta {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(232,98,44,0.2);
}
.problem-cta:hover {
  background: var(--accent-light);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(232,98,44,0.3);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .problem-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .problem-cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
